# Web Components authoring

`@rosettadash/web-components` is the **canonical implementation** for every component. Other runtimes port or wrap this layer.

## Base classes

| Pattern | Base | DOM |
|---------|------|-----|
| Native atoms | `RosettaAtomElement` | Light DOM |
| Manual media | `HTMLElement` + shadow pair loader | Shadow DOM |

Extend `RosettaAtomElement` (`src/lib/rosetta-atom-element.ts`) for generated natives — do not subclass `HTMLElement` directly unless `pattern: 'manual'`.

## Native atom checklist

- Class: `Rd{ExportName}Element extends RosettaAtomElement`
- `static readonly tagName = RD_*_TAG` (kebab, `rd-` prefix)
- `static get observedAttributes()` — scalar attrs only
- `buildMarkup(): string` — BEM `rd-*` structure matching shared template
- `registerRd{ExportName}()` — idempotent `customElements.define`
- Export tag constant + class + register from subpath index

## Manual CE checklist (media, maps, wasm)

- Shadow DOM via `loadShadowPairForTag` where styles are encapsulated
- `setProperty(key, value)` for `File`, `Blob`, object arrays, crop regions
- `observedAttributes` for scalars only — never JSON on attributes
- `disconnectedCallback`: revoke object URLs, abort workers, remove listeners

## Events

```ts
this.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('video-file', { detail, bubbles: true, composed: true }));
```

Use kebab-case event names aligned with `11-component-public-contract.mdc`.

## Styles

- Component CSS lives with CE (shadow pair or global `styles.css` rules targeting `rd-*` in light DOM).
- Use `--rd-*` variables with fallbacks — no `--db-*`.

## Catalog CEs

`src/catalog/*` (component-spec, palette-catalog) are Storybook/builder tooling — not manifest palette atoms. Do not conflate with public taxonomy exports.

## Browser bundle

`@rosettadash/web-components/browser/media` — esbuild bundle for no-build HTML apps. Update via `scripts/bundle-browser-media.mjs` when media CE public API changes.

## Must not

- Import React, Angular, Vue, or Svelte
- Fetch network resources without documented props
- Register globals beyond `customElements`

